// The game's identity: what the engine calls it and where it keeps its
// files.
//
// - title: the window's title, and the crash report's;
// - folder: the name of its folder for the settings and the logs (in
//   ~/.config, Application Support or %APPDATA%), and of its crash report
//   (FOLDER-crash.log);
// - logo: the title on the start menu, its first part in white and the
//   rest in rust orange;
// - icon: the window's icon, a PNG in the content pack (none if left out);
// - updates: where its releases are published, for it to update itself.
(
    title: "Motorust",
    folder: "motorust",
    logo: (plain: "MOTO", accent: "RUST"),
    icon: Some("icon-256.png"),
    // Where the releases are published, for the game to update itself (the
    // engine's src/updater.rs): {version} is the release's ("0.0.18"),
    // {target} the platform's ("x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu"). The site's
    // version.txt is written by web/build.sh; the archives are those
    // release.yml uploads, and the sums its GitHub release's.
    updates: Some((
        latest: "https://motorust.germade.dev/version.txt",
        archive: "https://motorust.germade.dev/downloads/motorust-{version}-{target}",
        sums: "https://github.com/germadev/motorust/releases/download/v{version}/SHA256SUMS.txt",
    )),
)
